From: openRuyi Project Contributors
Subject: [PATCH] build: allow newer Cython releases

The openRuyi build environment provides Cython 3.2.4, which is newer than
the upstream build floor and remains compatible with grpcio's generated code.

Upstream-Reference: https://github.com/grpc/grpc/tree/v1.84.0
Upstream-Status: Downstream (portability adjustment)

--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -16,5 +16,5 @@
     "setuptools>=77.0.1",
     "wheel",
-    "cython==3.1.1"
+    "cython>=3.1.1"
 ]
 build-backend = "setuptools.build_meta"
--- a/setup.py
+++ b/setup.py
@@ -582 +582 @@
-        SETUP_REQUIRES += ("cython==3.1.1",)
+        SETUP_REQUIRES += ("cython>=3.1.1",)
